  "resume": "This is a Swiss TV news report from the Tagesschau broadcast on 5 September 1974 covering the political petition regarding the Bernese Jura conflict, specifically the demand for the districts of Courtelary, Moutier, and La Neuveville to remain with the Canton of Bern. It shows the handover of signature packets to the Federal Chancellery in Bern."
